{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a sensory overload in the best possible way. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant energy of the city. Tokyo's neon-lit streets were a feast for the eyes, with towering skyscrapers and bustling streets filled with people from all walks of life.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I sampled the freshest sushi of my life. The market's chaotic atmosphere was exhilarating, with vendors hawking their wares and the sound of sizzling seafood filling the air.\n\nI also had the opportunity to visit the serene Meiji Shrine, a tranquil oasis in the midst of the bustling city. The shrine's peaceful atmosphere was a welcome respite from the hustle and bustle of Tokyo, and I felt a deep sense of calm as I wandered through the beautiful gardens.\n\nAs I traveled throughout Japan, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture. From ancient temples to cutting-edge technology, Japan is a country that seamlessly blends old and new. My trip was a fascinating glimpse into this captivating culture, and I left with a newfound appreciation for the beauty and complexity of Japan. I can't wait to return and explore more of what this incredible country has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.5595460534095764}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.004180265124887228}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -8.4638240878121e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20428094267845154}, {"token": " sensory", "logprob": -1.5812299251556396}, {"token": " overload", "logprob": -0.035759229212999344}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.00016878610767889768}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.78813775164599